# Header.js — Header / Mobile Navigation Toggle

## Layman's terms

Makes the hamburger menu work. When you tap the menu icon on mobile, it opens and closes the navigation. Handles the toggle button and overlay.

## Medium understanding

Migrated from WordPress footer snippet. Controls `.sec-mobile-toggle` and `.sec-menu-wrapper`. Click toggles `sec-menu-active` on body and `sec-menu-open` on menu. Retries init if elements not yet in DOM (Thrive async load). No external deps.

## Advanced

- **Pattern:** IIFE, DOMContentLoaded or immediate if already loaded
- **Classes:** sec-mobile-toggle, sec-menu-wrapper, sec-menu-active, sec-menu-open
- **Used by:** Header component; embedded in pages via Thrive
